<title>HONG KONG: C.Lyonnais sets warrants on Lai Sun Dev.</title>
<headline>C.Lyonnais sets warrants on Lai Sun Dev.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Credit Lyonnais Financial Products (Guernsey) Ltd said on Wednesday it has launched up to 380 million American-style call warrants on shares of Lai Sun Development Co Ltd.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	HK$11.25     PREMIUM	 20 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	 HK$0.225     GEARING	 5.0X</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	  13.NOV.97    PAYDATE	 25.NOV.96</p>
<p> LISTING	     HONG KONG    MIN EXER LOT  10,000</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE    HK$1l.25</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
